ack"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":900,"def":1100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"unequipped_blade":{"slug":"unequipped_blade","name":"Unequipped Blade","icon":"/enemies-icons/Unequipped Blade.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue weapon components produced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Unsafe to hold before assembly, but still more threatening than empty hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","Operators equipped with this gain increased ATK","When equipped by enemies","Units equipped with this gain increased ATK","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"assault_arts_unit":{"slug":"assault_arts_unit","name":"Assault Arts Unit","icon":"/enemies-icons/Assault Arts Unit.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue staff components produced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Often malfunctions, but better than letting an Infected cast Arts with their bare hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","For a short time after activating their skills, Operators equipped with this deal additional Arts damage and inflict Frighten for a fixed duration when dealing damage","When equipped by enemies","Attacks by units equipped with this deal Arts damage; the first attack after pickup prevents the target from attacking or healing for a period of time","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"protective_vest":{"slug":"protective_vest","name":"Protective Vest","icon":"/enemies-icons/Protective Vest.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue protective gear components produced by Londinium's factories, only large enough to protect one side of the body. Everyone hopes to nab a piece or two and sew them together before they suffer a serious blow.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","Operators equipped with this gain increased DEF","When equipped by enemies","Units equipped with this take reduced damage from the designated direction","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"freight_car":{"slug":"freight_car","name":"Freight Car","icon":"/enemies-icons/Freight Car.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"The pride of Victoria's industrial automation, vastly improving transport efficiency between factories. Its designers traded defense for speed, trusting in Londinium's peace and stability.","abilities":["Unblockable; can be attacked by enemies","Drops gear in the surrounding area when defeated and stuns all nearby units; resumes movement after a period of time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.45,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":0,"def":150,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"millscar_mercenary":{"slug":"millscar_mercenary","name":"'Millscar' Mercenary","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Millscar' Mercenary.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Phy